#      four launches collapse into a single graph launch.  The cache is keyed
#      on the exact memory the graph reads (data pointers, shapes, strides,
#      dtypes, devices), and every call still returns a `.clone()` of the
#      graph's output buffer so the observable aliasing semantics of the naive
